{"quest_id": "Sotha_assassin", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "31087297272941227855", "text": "Kill the Overclocker and Abstemious Leaders", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8432553}, {"info_id": "19598271461103222033", "text": "I have killed both leaders. I was rewarded with a set of armor of my choice, as well as a good deal of money.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8432951}, {"info_id": "33511361521431399", "text": "I killed the shady fabricant instead.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8433195}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "Sotha_assassindead", "journal_index": 25}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "291382673306547788", "parent_topic": "little job", "speaker_id": "sotha_assasssinman", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "11227264302771424104", "parent_topic": "little job", "speaker_id": "sotha_assasssinman", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_baby", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "1657827405144666488", "text": "Role Call", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8457249}, {"info_id": "6998184572170325649", "text": "The Foremer thanked me, rather quickly, and rewarded me with some armor and a key.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8457687}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2917820360548416746", "parent_topic": "job for you", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "11517219481587414976", "parent_topic": "job for you", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_baby2", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "25994228103122323076", "text": "I convinced Adaira to see the Foremer.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8456701}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_baby3", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "1038015412771720900", "text": "I convinced Ineriab to see the Foremer.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8456884}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_baby4", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "29598111542990411156", "text": "I convinced Kuteba to see the Foremer.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8457067}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_bodyparts", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "199022289310138668", "text": "Reconstruction", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8427915}, {"info_id": "8547193051545611531", "text": "I found the rest of the hanged man's body, and helped rebuild him. He was grateful, and though poor, rewarded me nonetheless.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8428309}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2967263540325710", "parent_topic": "body parts", "speaker_id": "sotha_hangedman", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "29449279631595929213", "parent_topic": "body parts", "speaker_id": "sotha_hangedman", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_breakin", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "4833457230421162", "text": "The Heist", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8439688}, {"info_id": "18985247972907230286", "text": "I gave Numinar the cutting sphere, and was rewarded in turn.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8441320}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_watchgate", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "Sotha_watchprocess", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "3125398593178916924", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_numinar", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "299362097696129958", "parent_topic": "help me", "speaker_id": "sotha_numinar", "journal_index": 20}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_centurion", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "5021681099339081", "text": "I, Centurion", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8426012}, {"info_id": "29374111352392721396", "text": "Kummuuuu thanked me for the return of his centurion, and rewarded me with a key for Fyr Manor.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8427373}, {"info_id": "318021827790510393", "text": "I lied and told Kummuuuu that his centurion was destroyed and unrecoverable. He thanked me, but regretted the loss of one of his prized machines.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8427603}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "18070163391289428078", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_Kummuuuu", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "219951889770761344", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_centurion", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "156596118599532405", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_ghost", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "277131772803720717", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_Kummuuuu", "journal_index": 65}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1414130709214508809", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_centurion", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "235922849238016185", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_guide", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "26624275811996032118", "parent_topic": "missing centurion", "speaker_id": "sotha_Kummuuuu", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_clocktower", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "16475138491903524647", "text": "Clocktower Crazy", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8424405}, {"info_id": "2797888873156131553", "text": "I freed the fabricant, who, predictably, attacked me. I have killed him, and the clocktower is safe from whatever he wanted to do with it.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8425379}, {"info_id": "2587298202765925777", "text": "I convinced the fabricant that his schemes were pointless, and freed him. He will no longer attempt any sort of... whatever, and the clocktower is safe from whatever he wanted to do with it.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8425655}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_clocktowernotes", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "132911917723285107", "parent_topic": "upper clocktower", "speaker_id": "sotha_clocktowermanager", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2772910952067923803", "parent_topic": "upper clocktower", "speaker_id": "sotha_clocktowermanager", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "129086490623121", "parent_topic": "upper clocktower", "speaker_id": "sotha_clocktowermanager", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "11342307211608925193", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_clockvillain", "journal_index": 45}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1964214622661622898", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_clockvillain", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1307318131803963", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_clockvillain", "journal_index": 30}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_endgame", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "128149733138411315", "text": "The Chronographers", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8446518}, {"info_id": "153161036860437288", "text": "I have given the Archcanon the starmap. They have departed the city to live among the stars.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8446849}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1808354671222417201", "parent_topic": "final favor", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon2", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "204492110761853376", "parent_topic": "final favor", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon2", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_farmer1", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "28429326613188623287", "text": "A Tale of Two Farmers: The Naturalist", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8441544}, {"info_id": "16584220652868921959", "text": "I returned to the farmer, who thanked and rewarded me, despite his rival not being arrested yet.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8442317}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "3106013753331711943", "parent_topic": "other farmer", "speaker_id": "sotha_farmerQ1", "journal_index": 30}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_farmer2", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "938277122322126410", "text": "A Tale of Two Farmers: The Mechanist", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8442579}, {"info_id": "26468369120395425", "text": "I returned to the farmer, who thanked and rewarded me, despite his rival not being arrested yet.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8443346}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "71689928256171512", "parent_topic": "other farmer", "speaker_id": "sotha_farmerL2", "journal_index": 30}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_farmer3", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "28017272661419510024", "text": "Both farmers have been arrested for evidence that suggests their fabricants were poisoned.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8443606}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_fightring", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "709779837941226", "text": "Fight Club", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8429224}, {"info_id": "27466252201068028198", "text": "The Abstemious learned of my success, and thanked and rewarded me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8430807}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_fightringdeath", "journal_index": 47}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_fightringkill", "journal_index": 47}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_freefabricants", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_openfabdoors", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2560730259215156043", "parent_topic": "escort you", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringfarmer", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "16063235081962329956", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemiousfightr", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "31155207393113420023", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringfarmer", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2814622381154412513", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemiousfightr", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_fish", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "2590320892253413155", "text": "Aquatic Pest Control", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8459257}, {"info_id": "395022730474324306", "text": "I have killed all the slaughterfish. Lokan rewarded me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8459602}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "714326906307029930", "parent_topic": "fabricant slaughterfish", "speaker_id": "sotha_Lokan", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "23889313981452828491", "parent_topic": "fabricant slaughterfish", "speaker_id": "sotha_Lokan", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_headless", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "77268916105027842", "text": "Getting Ahead", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8433397}, {"info_id": "3924289642315218991", "text": "I returned the headless man's head. He was grateful, and rewarded me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8433997}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "sotha_home", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "30262426764165164", "text": "The Archcanon of Sotha Sil has provided a way for me to come and go between Mundus and the Clockwork City. There is now an active portal in Fyr Manor that will take me to and from the area.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8461221}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "221351957056226816", "parent_topic": "return to Tamriel", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_husband", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "18182238871149927560", "text": "A Watery Affair", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8438559}, {"info_id": "83285933700612916", "text": "Though reluctant, Subori believed me about her husband's rather innocent activities. I was rewarded for my time.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8439412}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_imperfections", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "16712285172920526569", "text": "Alpharius has told me that if I find strange or 'imperfect' objects, that I can trade them to him for rewards.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8423460}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2922872482660912732", "parent_topic": "imperfections", "speaker_id": "sotha_clockseller", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_legs", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "291691433092001691", "text": "The Legs of Seht", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8460376}, {"info_id": "199684922803629497", "text": "In my quest to reach the city, I managed to find all six pieces of Sotha Sil's legs. A fabricant in the clockwork city helped me rebuild them into a powerful pair of greaves.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8460508}, {"info_id": "330316386918121400", "text": "I spoke to a fabricant who told me of six pieces that, when assembled by him, would become a powerful pair of greaves. Unfortunately, these pieces were lost in the outer city, and because I cannot return there, I can never rebuild these greaves.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8460816}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "8028108012587611246", "parent_topic": "Legs of Seht", "speaker_id": "sotha_footshrine", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "26210319482115710670", "parent_topic": "Legs of Seht", "speaker_id": "sotha_footshrine", "journal_index": 15}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_lich", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "404618857164723835", "text": "Licherous Intentions", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8458427}, {"info_id": "1965827359686523094", "text": "As promised, I was rewarded.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8459066}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_lichscript", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "128042997310171965", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_rewound_indus", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1533285481127812887", "parent_topic": "helper", "speaker_id": "sotha_rewound_indus", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_lostmind", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "2772021977160814675", "text": "Lost My Mind", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8431040}, {"info_id": "816425851256022865", "text": "I returned the mind part to the overclocker. Unfortunately, he learned that he was previously an abstemious, and the realization has only served to depress him.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8431466}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "24875175136026352", "parent_topic": "my mind", "speaker_id": "sotha_lostmind", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2160618342311114815", "parent_topic": "my mind", "speaker_id": "sotha_lostmind", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_Manor", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "14532109541449727795", "text": "Rebuilding Fyr Manor", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8455142}, {"info_id": "1287108202511027426", "text": "My servant in Fyr Manor has informed me that Fyr Manor is broken. Apparently it had many extra rooms that were lost over the years. These rooms were stored in special keys, that were, again, lost. If I can retrieve these keys and bring them back to Fyr Manor, the rooms will be restored. He does not know how many rooms there are in all.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8455281}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_maze", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "291881455319326592", "text": "A Lab Rat", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8459816}, {"info_id": "2624028575975116524", "text": "I escaped the maze and killed the wizard.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8460173}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_mazeattack", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "256962623782427464", "parent_topic": "maze", "speaker_id": "sotha_mazewizard2", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_measurer", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "11249182792312619272", "text": "Scaling New Heights", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8431792}, {"info_id": "1737344612143326559", "text": "I have placed all of the contraptions in their places. The Overclocker has offered me a token for a free augmentation as a reward.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8432256}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_Memory", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "26437163396205454", "text": "I've sorted the Assembly General's memories, and as such it has allowed me to leave.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8452131}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "31243216771823429573", "parent_topic": "rendering assistance", "speaker_id": "sotha_assemblygeneral1", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "241221959712925602", "parent_topic": "memory scan", "speaker_id": "sotha_assemblygeneral1", "journal_index": 20}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_murders", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "32514830514832130", "text": "Murders in the Residential District", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8444607}, {"info_id": "28155259841125329772", "text": "Aroban was surprised that Miri was behind it, but ultimately wasn't that surprised. He rewarded me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8446254}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "6411207941695812038", "parent_topic": "undead services", "speaker_id": "sotha_rewound_indus", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "7309198842291922124", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_sehtlybartender", "journal_index": 65}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "147671038571928339", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_miri3", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "23147154886163923", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_miri2", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "82628922148522181", "parent_topic": "chopped up", "speaker_id": "sotha_miri", "journal_index": 20}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_newguard", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "183675480634711534", "text": "The New Guard", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8434228}, {"info_id": "873324881997527174", "text": "I have beaten Urusai, who, true to his word, has wandered off to become the containment tower's new guard.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8435029}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "3042919500806225330", "parent_topic": "guard the tower", "speaker_id": "sotha_oldbrawler", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1361480072888515029", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_oldbrawler", "journal_index": 30}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_normal", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "29588220822717127238", "text": "When in Sotha Sil, do as the Sotha Silians do", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8449658}, {"info_id": "888788362952613074", "text": "I returned to the normal man with the good news. He was thankful, and rewarded me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8451140}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "290112512230255767", "parent_topic": "normal person", "speaker_id": "sotha_normalman", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1738714543112757869", "parent_topic": "normal person", "speaker_id": "sotha_normalman", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "20424133151228312013", "parent_topic": "fit in", "speaker_id": "sotha_normalman", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "19024321001484122663", "parent_topic": "fit in", "speaker_id": "sotha_normalman", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "15357100574536402", "parent_topic": "fee", "speaker_id": "sotha_aughead", "journal_index": 40}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_penance", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "488723687203242303", "text": "Slagtown Redemption", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8447105}, {"info_id": "290852407190318273", "text": "Having used all four beggar's shrines in the Slums, I have managed to force the slum denizens to forgive me. I should be able to freely use their services now.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8448018}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "19667226071414910111", "parent_topic": "Slums", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_pevlar", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "32731762471291617", "text": "Advertising", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8448340}, {"info_id": "19715816584910707", "text": "I handed out all four flyers, and returned to Pevlar. He has rewarded me with a Fyr Manor key.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8448925}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "12844394476729967", "parent_topic": "advertisement", "speaker_id": "sotha_pevlar", "journal_index": 20}]}
{"quest_id": "sotha_pilgrimage", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "434119412800025782", "text": "Gear Pilgrimage", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8423720}, {"info_id": "557620176873229603", "text": "I have completed the pilgrimage, and returned to the priest. I was rewarded with his blessing.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8424145}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "sotha_plantsave", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "15058147762638618253", "text": "The Great Plant Rescue", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8428602}, {"info_id": "207223250125631238", "text": "I recovered the plant and returned to Golamus. Subsequently, I was rewarded.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8428982}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "sotha_quartz", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "242201399765627519", "text": "Finding Quartz", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8449181}, {"info_id": "1798817488480218799", "text": "The quartz smith in the Arboretum has given me a pickaxe. If I use it to mine bits of quartz (which can be found around the city) he will trade me such quartz for actual quartz armor.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8449312}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_romance", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "210053531548014167", "text": "A Show To Remember", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8443843}, {"info_id": "191742330912169478", "text": "I set up the fireworks, which the man detonated. Unforunately, they went off too early, and the entire district caught fire.\r\nI was rewarded anyways.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8444294}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1208318109242739049", "parent_topic": "love problem", "speaker_id": "sotha_lovestruck", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "17450289271220527022", "parent_topic": "love problem", "speaker_id": "sotha_lovestruck", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "Sotha_train", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "243982603261322679", "text": "Flying Trains", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8455782}, {"info_id": "130517508263816934", "text": "I returned to Venluen, who awkwardly thanked and rewarded me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8456477}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_cart2", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1371121048997530196", "parent_topic": "cart systems", "speaker_id": "sotha_trainman", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1764214764712111940", "parent_topic": "cart systems", "speaker_id": "sotha_trainman", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "SSE_catacombs", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "575122789237788826", "text": "Dead Hour", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8435300}, {"info_id": "161523746763426077", "text": "All the liches are dead, and the Temple district is once again safe.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8438326}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_catacombmodule", "journal_index": 110}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "12859333112745391", "parent_topic": "undead attacks", "speaker_id": "sotha_tearhead", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1833636392302431881", "parent_topic": "undead attacks", "speaker_id": "sotha_buildhead", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "54322688615999625", "parent_topic": "undead attacks", "speaker_id": "sotha_wonderhead", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2793614316478411011", "parent_topic": "undead attacks", "speaker_id": "sotha_watchhead", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "731192262347828097", "parent_topic": "augmentations", "speaker_id": "sotha_armsmerchant", "journal_index": 90}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "4809133622565424084", "parent_topic": "augmentations", "speaker_id": "sotha_templevictim1", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "16048133063033728712", "parent_topic": "our work", "speaker_id": "sotha_rewound_UN4", "journal_index": 100}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2396530261098126929", "parent_topic": "Temple", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "SSE_Endgame", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "890030372391221834", "text": "I have chosen to save Gestalt and the city. Gestalt, or perhaps now Sotha Sil, thanked me, and gave me his lab and the city to watch over. He requested that, should he ever go mad, I be the one to destroy him permanently.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8453884}, {"info_id": "2297112498378921292", "text": "I have chosen to destroy Gestalt, and by extension the Clockwork City. As he died, he thanked me for releasing him from the binds of life, and gave me his lab, which will still function. He warned me that the city will be dead now, though perhaps it is for the best.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8454242}], "external_references": []}
{"quest_id": "SSE_openPath", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "2659161702705126077", "text": "I have eased the troubles of all the districts in the city, and as such, the Archcanon has opened a doorway into the workshop of Sotha Sil. This doorway is located in the Clocktower, in the Hub District.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8451384}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "962103311177626371", "parent_topic": "ease the troubles", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "SSE_power", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "21526171231099715629", "text": "Power Corrupts", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8467217}, {"info_id": "8652128761711715", "text": "I have entered the generator chamber, and confronted the three fabricants. While they seemed generally unaware that they would be destroying the entire city, they nevertheless put up a fight. Unfortunately, the energies of the core overwhelmed all of us, but before I perished I was rescued by the Foremer, who seems now willing to talk to me. It also seems that the power outages have stopped.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8470520}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_power_notconvinced", "journal_index": 90}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2239614278385730360", "parent_topic": "investigate", "speaker_id": "sotha_powerman", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "39011632797946221", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_powerman2", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "158922234737645553", "parent_topic": "Industrial", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "3221453071829813084", "parent_topic": "Industrial", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "14889243061255525880", "parent_topic": "advantage", "speaker_id": "sotha_powerman", "journal_index": 80}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "15715282992812616228", "parent_topic": "material", "speaker_id": "sotha_powerman", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "560253751134430906", "parent_topic": "analyze", "speaker_id": "sotha_powerman", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "259386222283403577", "parent_topic": "trio", "speaker_id": "sotha_clockersecret", "journal_index": 70}]}
{"quest_id": "SSE_slums", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "28310111331986012760", "text": "District of the Undead", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8461550}, {"info_id": "167671030844051003", "text": "I have killed the Pocket Cabal, ending the madness in the slums. However because I killed so many fabricants to reach the monster, the residents of this district are furious, and will no longer talk to me.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8463168}, {"info_id": "28392288721165118693", "text": "I have killed the Pocket Cabal, ending the madness in the slums. Because I avoided taking the lives of the innocent but mad fabricants, I am hailed as a merciful hero.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8463511}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "pocket_cabalscript", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "pocket_cabalscript", "journal_index": 55}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2855125009400819122", "parent_topic": "Slums", "speaker_id": "sotha_controllerslums", "journal_index": 25}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "21856211322129910653", "parent_topic": "Slums", "speaker_id": "sotha_controllerslums", "journal_index": 25}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "30897123171751210369", "parent_topic": "Slums", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}]}
{"quest_id": "SSE_trees", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "14594323913120525177", "text": "The Roots That Go Deep", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8463839}, {"info_id": "1561910434266808463", "text": "I killed the Gardener, ending the infection at the cost of the District's overseer.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8466769}, {"info_id": "7741185601566030416", "text": "I convinced the Gardener to let me cure him, ending the infection.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8466990}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "__Sotha_fabricant_Gardender", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_tree_flowblock", "journal_index": 25}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_tree_inspect", "journal_index": 27}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_tree_trackcant", "journal_index": 29}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "27271326863223111447", "parent_topic": "cure the disease", "speaker_id": "Sotha_fabricant_Portal", "journal_index": 65}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1302320630256728059", "parent_topic": "cure the disease", "speaker_id": "sotha_tree2", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1302320630256728059", "parent_topic": "cure the disease", "speaker_id": "sotha_tree2", "journal_index": 55}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "2431414199909622043", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_tree1", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "707625871259724076", "parent_topic": "Arboretum", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "7658294843603233", "parent_topic": "infection", "speaker_id": "Sotha_fabricant_Portal", "journal_index": 40}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "60114075313548692", "parent_topic": "infection", "speaker_id": "Sotha_fabricant_Portal", "journal_index": 20}]}
{"quest_id": "SSE_war", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "21813880776025210", "text": "Class Warfare", "quest_flags": {"QSTN": 1}, "source_offset": 8471070}, {"info_id": "13802130792308527021", "text": "I confronted and killed Relamus, who had several rogue Watchmen to help him. The problems in the Residential District should stop now.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8475933}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_war_crate", "journal_index": 70}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "_war_forcegreet", "journal_index": 140}, {"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "sotha_vendingmachinescript", "journal_index": 130}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "242731812491271894", "parent_topic": "spreading rumors", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemious_leader", "journal_index": 110}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "13862281482866916411", "parent_topic": "Residential", "speaker_id": "sotha_archcanon", "journal_index": 10}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "20032107132854013021", "parent_topic": "Greeting 1", "speaker_id": "sotha_relamus", "journal_index": 120}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "6753324521341931097", "parent_topic": "pamphlets", "speaker_id": "sotha_suleri", "journal_index": 100}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "3253999867054768", "parent_topic": "pamphlets", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemious_leader", "journal_index": 90}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "19129165752154224774", "parent_topic": "track it", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemious_leader", "journal_index": 20}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "19129165752154224774", "parent_topic": "track it", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemious_leader", "journal_index": 30}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "3088219414117947654", "parent_topic": "addict", "speaker_id": "sotha_sugarsupplier", "journal_index": 80}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "33511030440576704", "parent_topic": "addict", "speaker_id": "sotha_relamus", "journal_index": 60}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "205247681119929323", "parent_topic": "addict", "speaker_id": "sotha_sehtlybartender", "journal_index": 50}, {"source_type": "INFO", "source_id": "1905843551515415820", "parent_topic": "addict", "speaker_id": "sotha_addict", "journal_index": 40}]}
{"quest_id": "TR_SothaSil", "journal_entries": [{"info_id": "121229930197212643", "text": "I have been transported to Sotha Sil's Clockwork City.", "quest_flags": {"QSTF": 1}, "source_offset": 8452374}], "external_references": [{"source_type": "SCPT", "source_id": "SothaSilTeleport", "journal_index": 20}]}
